{
  "mn101:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 101 ",
  "mn101:0.2": "Devadahasutta ",
  "mn101:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn101:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati devadahaṁ nāma sakyānaṁ nigamo. ",
  "mn101:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn101:2.1": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn101:2.2": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn101:2.3": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn101:2.4": "“santi, bhikkhave, eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā evaṁvādino evaṁdiṭṭhino: ",
  "mn101:2.5": "‘yaṁ kiñcāyaṁ purisapuggalo paṭisaṁvedeti sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā, sabbaṁ taṁ pubbekatahetu. ",
  "mn101:2.6": "Iti purāṇānaṁ kammānaṁ tapasā byantībhāvā, navānaṁ kammānaṁ akaraṇā, āyatiṁ anavassavo; ",
  "mn101:2.7": "āyatiṁ anavassavā kammakkhayo; kammakkhayā dukkhakkhayo; dukkhakkhayā vedanākkhayo; vedanākkhayā sabbaṁ dukkhaṁ nijjiṇṇaṁ bhavissatī’ti. ",
  "mn101:2.8": "Evaṁvādino, bhikkhave, nigaṇṭhā. ",
  "mn101:3.1": "Evaṁvādāhaṁ, bhikkhave, nigaṇṭhe upasaṅkamitvā evaṁ vadāmi: ",
  "mn101:3.2": "‘saccaṁ kira tumhe, āvuso nigaṇṭhā, evaṁvādino evaṁdiṭṭhino—",
  "mn101:3.3": "yaṁ kiñcāyaṁ purisapuggalo paṭisaṁvedeti sukhaṁ vā dukkhaṁ vā adukkhamasukhaṁ vā, sabbaṁ taṁ pubbekatahetu. ",
  "mn101:3.4": "Iti purāṇānaṁ kammānaṁ tapasā byantībhāvā, navānaṁ kammānaṁ akaraṇā, āyatiṁ anavassavo; ",
  "mn101:3.5": 